scene uikit_demo

include "../hud.lvns"
include "../panel.lvns"

uikit_hud_title = "THE NORTHERN PASS"
uikit_hud_subtitle = "Stormfront · 18:42"
uikit_hp = 73
uikit_hp_max = 100
uikit_hp_label = "VITALS"
uikit_resource = 46
uikit_resource_max = 80
uikit_resource_label = "AETHER"
uikit_badge_label = "DAY"
uikit_badge_value = "07"

uikit_panel_kicker = "CURRENT OBJECTIVE"
uikit_panel_title = "Find shelter before nightfall"
uikit_panel_body = "The abandoned forge lies beyond the ridge."

goto uikit_demo_start

:uikit_demo_start
bg sprite_url="/content/bg/forest.jpg"
uikit_hud_show()
uikit_panel_show()
The Arcplate UI kit is active.

- Take damage -> uikit_demo_damage
- Spend aether -> uikit_demo_aether
- Open modal -> uikit_demo_modal
- Finish -> uikit_demo_finish

:uikit_demo_damage
uikit_hp = max(0, uikit_hp - 17)
uikit_hud_refresh()
goto uikit_demo_start

:uikit_demo_aether
uikit_resource = max(0, uikit_resource - 13)
uikit_hud_refresh()
goto uikit_demo_start

:uikit_demo_modal
uikit_modal_kicker = "FIELD NOTE"
uikit_modal_title = "The pass is watched"
uikit_modal_body = "Choose another route before the storm arrives."
uikit_modal_show()
The modal uses the same material language as the HUD.
uikit_modal_hide()
goto uikit_demo_start

:uikit_demo_finish
uikit_panel_hide()
uikit_hud_hide()
goto __end
